'''Homura Akemi''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 14.1 Update#Version 14.1.1 Update|Version 14.1.1]] increases damage, time between attacks, attack animation, and grants [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] and [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] targetting, [[Long Distance]] and [[Strong Against]].

